26-05-12.22:43:23.380 [main            ] INFO  AiAgentAutoConfigTest  - 测试结果:["```java\nimport java.util.List;\nimport com.alibaba.fastjson.JSONObject;\nimport com.baidu.aip.util.HttpUtil;\nimport com.baidu.aip.util.Util;\n\npublic class SpringAISearch {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String query = \"最新的Spring AI框架特性\";\n        String model = \"ERNIE-3.5-8K\";\n        String instruction = \"总结搜索结果\";\n        float temperature = 0.7f;\n        float top_p = 0.8f;\n        List<JSONObject> resource_type_filter = List.of(\n            new JSONObject() {{ put(\"type\", \"web\"); put(\"top_k\", 10) }}\n        );\n\n        String result = AIsearch(query, instruction, model, temperature, top_p, null, resource_type_filter);\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n\n    private static String AIsearch(String query, String instruction, String model, float temperature, float top_p, List<String> search_domain_filter, List<JSONObject> resource_type_filter) {\n        String url = \"https://aip.baidubce.com/rpc/2.0/ai_custom/v1/wenxinworkshop/search\";\n        JSONObject params = new JSONObject();\n        params.put(\"query\", query);\n        params.put(\"instruction\", instruction);\n        params.put(\"model\", model);\n        params.put(\"temperature\", temperature);\n        params.put(\"top_p\", top_p);\n        if (search_domain_filter != null) {\n            params.put(\"search_domain_filter\", search_domain_filter);\n        }\n        if (resource_type_filter != null) {\n            params.put(\"resource_type_filter\", resource_type_filter);\n        }\n        String accessToken = \"your_access_token\";\n        String response = HttpUtil.post(url, accessToken, params.toJSONString());\n        return response;\n    }\n}\n```\n请将上述代码中的`your_access_token`替换为你自己真实的访问令牌。你可能还需要根据实际情况调整搜索的URL和参数等内容。同时，确保你已经引入了相关的依赖库，如FastJSON等。\n\n请注意，这只是一个基于假设的百度API进行搜索和总结的示例代码，实际的搜索和总结逻辑可能需要根据你所使用的真实搜索服务和API进行调整。 ","- **Correctness**:\n    - The code seems to be structured correctly to perform a search and potentially get a summarized result using the provided parameters. However, it's hard to fully assess without knowing the exact behavior of the `AIsearch` method which depends on the external API.\n- **Readability**:\n    - The code is generally clear. It follows a common pattern of setting up parameters and making an API call. The use of the `JSONObject` from FastJSON is also appropriate. However, the use of the double brace initializer for creating the `JSONObject` in the `resource_type_filter` list might be a bit less common and could be made more explicit.\n- **Efficiency**:\n    - Without more information about the API and its performance characteristics, it's difficult to determine if there are any obvious performance bottlenecks. However, making an HTTP POST call with JSON data is a relatively standard operation.\n- **Edge Cases**:\n    - There is no explicit handling of potential edge cases such as invalid input values for the parameters, network failures during the API call, or unexpected responses from the API.\n- **Best Practices**:\n    - Hardcoding the `accessToken` as a string literal is a security risk. It should be stored more securely, perhaps in an environment variable or a configuration file.\n    - The code could benefit from adding more comments to explain the purpose of different sections, especially the construction of the `params` object and the API call.\n\nNo major issues found. However, it is recommended to address the security risk of hardcoding the access token and add more comments for better readability.","```java\nimport java.util.List;\nimport com.alibaba.fastjson.JSONObject;\nimport com.baidu.aip.util.HttpUtil;\nimport com.baidu.aip.util.Util;\n\n// 这个类用于执行Spring AI框架特性的搜索并获取总结结果\npublic class SpringAISearch {\n\n    // 主方法，程序入口\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        // 搜索查询关键词\n        String query = \"最新的Spring AI框架特性\";\n        // 指定使用的模型\n        String model = \"ERNIE-3.5-8K\";\n        // 控制搜索结果输出风格和格式的指令\n        String instruction = \"总结搜索结果\";\n        // 控制模型输出随机性的采样参数\n        float temperature = 0.7f;\n        // 控制模型输出多样性的核采样参数\n        float top_p = 0.8f;\n        // 指定搜索资源的类型和每种类型返回的结果数量\n        List<JSONObject> resource_type_filter = List.of(\n            new JSONObject() {{ put(\"type\", \"web\"); put(\"top_k\", 10) }}\n        );\n\n        // 执行搜索并获取结果\n        String result = AIsearch(query, instruction, model, temperature, top_p, null, resource_type_filter);\n        // 输出搜索结果\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n\n    // 执行搜索的方法\n    private static String AIsearch(String query, String instruction, String model, float temperature, float top_p, List<String> search_domain_filter, List<JSONObject> resource_type_filter) {\n        // 搜索的URL\n        String url = \"https://aip.baidubce.com/rpc/2.0/ai_custom/v1/wenxinworkshop/search\";\n        // 创建参数对象\n        JSONObject params = new JSONObject();\n        // 设置搜索查询关键词\n        params.put(\"query\", query);\n        // 设置控制搜索结果输出风格和格式的指令\n        params.put(\"instruction\", instruction);\n        // 设置指定使用的模型\n        params.put(\"model\", model);\n        // 设置控制模型输出随机性的采样参数\n        params.put(\"temperature\", temperature);\n        // 设置控制模型输出多样性的核采样参数\n        params.put(\"top_p\", top_p);\n        // 如果搜索领域过滤器不为空，添加到参数对象\n        if (search_domain_filter != null) {\n            params.put(\"search_domain_filter\", search_domain_filter);\n        }\n        // 如果资源类型过滤器不为空，添加到参数对象\n        if (resource_type_filter != null) {\n            params.put(\"resource_type_filter\", resource_type_filter);\n        }\n        // 从安全的地方获取访问令牌，这里假设已经通过环境变量或配置文件获取\n        String accessToken = System.getenv(\"BAIDU_API_ACCESS_TOKEN\");\n        // 发送HTTP POST请求并获取响应\n        String response = HttpUtil.post(url, accessToken, params.toJSONString());\n        // 返回响应结果\n        return response;\n    }\n}\n```"]
